.TH IEC-CALC-MCP 1 "November 2026" "iec-calc 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
iec-calc-mcp \- MCP server (stdio) for the IEC electricity plan calculator
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B iec-calc-mcp
.SH DESCRIPTION
Speaks newline-delimited JSON-RPC 2.0 on stdin/stdout, MCP protocol version
2025-06-18. Local only: no listener, no network access except the explicit
weather opt-in on analyze_csv (Open-Meteo, experimental).
Logs go to stderr at WARNING level; set MCP_DEBUG=1 for debug logging.
Stateless: every tool call reads the given local CSV path and retains nothing.
.SH TOOLS
.TP
.B analyze_csv {path, weather?, lat?, lon?}
Consumption profile: totals, base load, peaks, night/weekend and Shabbat split.
.TP
.B rank_plans {path, phase?, gas?, hot?, smart_meter?, current_plan?}
Annual-cost ranking of flat, Taoz and supplier plans. Conditional
(gas/HOT-customer) plans are excluded unless the matching flag is true.
.TP
.B explain_insights {path, lat?, lon?}
Descriptive observations and probabilistic appliance-signature detection.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR iec-calc (1)
